/E (Why each type: dictionary - quick lookup by train number; list - the stops have a fixed order \(route\) and are read by position; tuple - one stop is a fixed record \(station, arrival, departure\) that should not change; set - running days are unordered, unique and tested with day in days in O\(1\).)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [31]
>>
