/Title (Dictionary keyed by date: insert/lookup of any date is O\(1\) average, so late readings need no shifting and gaps are natural. The window is 7 lookups per day: O\(7n\), or O\(n\) with a running sum. Space is O\(n\) but larger \(hash table with keys + values, roughly 3-4x a list\).)
